OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCold and
OL,6,Fcloudy for most areas, although breaks
OL,7,Fdo develop mostly across eastern parts
OL,8,Fallowing a ground frost to form.
OL,9,FRemaining breezy along the coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CSaturday:FA dry start to the weekend,
OL,12,Fwith some sunnier spells across the
OL,13,Ffar east. Soon clouding over, with
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain, turning heavy by
OL,15,Fthe afternoon. A strong southeasterly
OL,16,Fwind.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
