OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FMorning
OL,6,Frain clearing, with sunshine to follow
OL,7,Fon Sunday. Cloudy but dry on Monday. A
OL,8,Fband of rain moves in later Tuesday.
OL,9,FAbove average temperatures for the
OL,10,Ftime of year.
